        <m>16t^{3}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{8t^{3}}{\sqrt{\left(8t^{3}\right)^{2}+\left(16t^{3}\right)^{2}}}</m>
      </p>
