    <solution><m>\mathbf{r}(t)</m> to obtain:
<me>\mathbf{r}'(t)=\langle 8t^{3},16t^{3} \rangle</me>
and so
<me>||\mathbf{r}'(t)||=\sqrt{\left(8t^{3}\right)^{2}+\left(16t^{3}\right)^{2}}.</me>
We now find the unit tangent vector:
<me>\mathbf{T}(t)
=\frac{\mathbf{r}'(t)}{||\mathbf{r}'(t)||}
=\frac{1}{\sqrt{\left(8t^{3}\right)^{2}+\left(16t^{3}\right)^{2}}}\langle 8t^{3}, 16t^{3} \rangle.</me>
For <m>t=3</m> we obtain the vector:
<me>\mathbf{T}(3)
=\frac{1}{\sqrt{233280}}\langle 216,432\rangle
=\left\langle \frac{216}{\sqrt{233280}}, \frac{432}{\sqrt{233280}} \right\rangle.</me>


</solution>
